SUMMARY:In The Other Room: Dan Docimo
LOCATION:Alpharetta
DESCRIPTION:Dan Docimo (they/them)  is a standup comic with cute hair and 
 a unique\, disarming style. Dan was listed as a comic to watch as part of 
  Time Out’s 2 025 Comics on the Rise.  They are also a member of the Pri
 me Time Cast at the Lincoln Lodge and producer-drummer of Dumb and Drummer.
  Most recently\, Dan opened for Louis C.K. at the Chicago Theatre during a 
 three-night run. Their credits include performances at the Limestone Comedy
  Festival\, 10\,000 Laughs Festival\, Altercation Comedy Festival\, and Art
  Basel. Dan loves bringing audiences to tears with their thoughtfully absur
 d musings. When Dan is not on stage\, you can find them failing at their da
 y job\, growing mushrooms at home or catching lobsters at the grocery store
 .\n\nThere is a two-item per person minimum in the Showroom\, which can be 
 fulfilled with any food or drink items from the menu.\n\nPLEASE NOTE: Food 
 and drinks purchased in the bar and lounge do not count towards the two-ite
 m minimum.\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers from enter
 ing the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nM
 ore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/in-the-other-room-dan-
